  "name": "Fusion Strike Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Shops in the Prerelease Program could hold unofficial Fusion Strike prerelease tournaments and sell the boxes from 6 November 2021. Each box held four Fusion Strike booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Fusion Strike logo. The packs also held a non-holo Dragapult, a card that is holofoil in booster packs, and Sword & Shield's non-holo Professor's Research, first found in that expansion's box.",
